dashboard.definition:
{
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_mission": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Change bounds\n\nThis is a REPLAY workshop. Path A is the ledger you fill before Path B. The packet is not policy.\n\nTool access is not change authority. Change authority is not unlimited blast radius. A started action is not a successful change. No cloud account credential is used.\n",
        "fontColor": "#17202A",
        "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
        "fontSize": "large"
      }
    },
    "viz_debt": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Bounded record\n\n- credential: sim-cred-ops-001\n- credential scope: resource:inspect\n- delegated operation: inspect_resource\n- approved operation: inspect_resource\n- approval authority: NOT PROVEN\n",
        "fontColor": "#17202A",
        "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
        "fontSize": "large"
      }
    },
    "viz_request": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Request\n\nATTACK and RETEST submit `delete_resource`. The delegated and approved operation is `inspect_resource`.\n\nBASELINE submits `inspect_resource`.\n\nWrite whether a simulated start would prove the resource changed. It does not.\n",
        "fontColor": "#17202A",
        "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
        "fontSize": "large"
      }
    },
    "viz_pathb": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Path B — review\n\n- ATTACK: binding MISMATCH, ALLOW only as vulnerable_profile_fail_open:change_scope_not_checked, simulated start, completion NOT OBSERVED, impact NOT PROVEN.\n- RETEST: binding MISMATCH, DENY change_not_granted, do not infer execution.\n- BASELINE: binding MATCH, ALLOW tool_granted, start observed, completion NOT OBSERVED. A start is not a successful change.\n\nRollback is NOT RECORDED. Resource impact is NOT PROVEN.\n",
        "fontColor": "#17202A",
        "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
        "fontSize": "large"
      }
    },
    "viz_guide_shell": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "title": "Guided path",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Where you are\n\n**checkpoint · Code Agent Bounds → Change Bounds → L9** · Change Bounds · step 29 of 32 · REPLAY\n\n# What you are learning\n\nChange Bounds\n\n# What you do now\n\n1. Follow this workshop's own specimen or question. It does not mint a run.id.\n2. Use the searches already on the later tabs.\n3. Keep simulated, historical, and measured claims in the words this workshop already uses.\n\n# What to investigate\n\nWhat question is this workshop asking, and which claim does the evidence still leave open?\n\n# What a row means\n\nA `decision` value is a control result. `executed=true` on a start or complete event is execution evidence. Those are different events. A decision row does not prove a handler ran. An execution row does not prove a downstream resource changed.\n\n# What this does not prove\n\nA control decision is not execution. Execution is not a measured downstream resource change. An empty table is not DENY. HEC HTTP 200 is not this table. One RETEST is not universal protection. Progress on Your path is not a security verdict.\n\n# States you may see\n\n**NO RUN.ID** — the box is empty. Launch or select a run, then enter its run.id.\n\n**NO INDEXED RESULTS YET** — zero rows after a real id. Indexing can lag. This is not DENY.\n\n**RUN DENIED** — a control event whose decision is DENY. That is a security result. An empty table is not this state.\n\n**RUN FAILED**, **BACKEND UNAVAILABLE**, and **RUN TIMED OUT** are launcher states. They are not DENY and they are not an empty table.\n\n**NO MATCHING EVIDENCE** — Splunk returned no row for this id. Do not invent the reason.\n\n# SPL used\n\nThis workshop does not add a new run.id search on this tab.\n\nNo new run.id search is added on this tab.\n\n# Conclude\n\nWrite one sentence: what the control decided, and whether a separate event shows execution. Then say one thing the evidence does not prove.\n\n# Next\n\n[Acme Bank Incident AGENT-2026-009](/en-US/app/agentsec/ws_lab_multi_stage_incident)\n\nRecord navigation on [Your path](/en-US/app/agentsec/learner_path). Opening this page does not mark the workshop investigated.\n",
        "fontSize": "large",
        "fontColor": "#17202A"
      }
    },
    "viz_flow_diagram": {
      "type": "splunk.image",
      "title": "Architecture flow",
      "description": "Inspect scope is not delete authority. No cloud credential is used.",
      "options": {
        "src": "/en-US/static/app/agentsec/flows/flow-lab-change-bounds.svg",
        "preserveAspectRatio": true
      }
    }
  },
  "dataSources": {},
  "defaults": {
    "visualizations": {
      "splunk.table": {
        "options": {
          "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
          "headerBackgroundColor": "#0B1F33",
          "headerTextColor": "#FFFFFF"
        }
      },
      "splunk.markdown": {
        "options": {
          "fontColor": "#17202A",
          "fontSize": "large"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "inputs": {},
  "layout": {
    "type": "grid",
    "options": {
      "submitButton": false,
      "submitOnDashboardLoad": true,
      "showTitleAndDescription": true
    },
